                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium Grade 4 CP 1 | UNS #R50700 is the strongest of the 4 commercially pure grades of Titanium. This grade is also recognized for superb corrosion resistance properties, good weldability, and excellent formability. Titanium Grade 4 has high oxygen and extra high strength properties and can be found primarily used in chemical processing, marine, and airframe applications."
                },
                {
