                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 4921](https://titanium.com/ams-4921-specification/) , [ASTM B348](https://titanium.com/astm-b348-specification/) , [ASTM F67 Gr 4](https://titanium.com/astm-f67-specification/) , [AMS-T-9047 Gr 4](https://titanium.com/ams-t-9047-specification/) , EN 10204 3.1"
